# Ignore everything in deploy/ except tracked scripts, config and notes
*
!.gitignore
# The installer's "What's New" page and the portable ZIP's README.txt.
!RELEASENOTES.txt
!README_portable.txt

# The clean-machine install harness. The directory has to be re-included before its
# contents, because git will not descend into an excluded directory at all.
!sandbox/
!sandbox/**

# The release package (build_avalonia_package.ps1), the same way.
!avalonia/
!avalonia/**

# What the two produce, ignored again after the re-includes above (a later rule wins): the
# sandbox payload run_sandbox_test.ps1 stages (and the .wsb, which carries absolute host paths),
# and the package's staged layout and the packages themselves.
sandbox/.work/
avalonia/staging/
avalonia/*.zip
avalonia/*_setup.exe
